---
import SectionBasic from "../../components/article/section-basic.astro";
import SectionReferences from "../../components/article/section-references.astro";
import ArticleLayout from "../../layouts/article-layout.astro";
import owl from "../../images/placeholder_owl.jpg";
import ArticleCallout from "../../components/article/article-callout.astro";
import ArticleImage from "../../components/article/article-image.astro";
import ArticleCards from "../../components/article/article-cards.astro";
import ArticleCard from "../../components/article/article-card.astro";
import ArticleCta from "../../components/article/article-cta.astro";
import ArticleFullsizeTable from "../../components/article/article-table.astro";
import SectionWithAside from "../../components/article/section-with-aside.astro";
---

<head>
  <title>Article1 | Virovek Learning Center</title>
</head>
<ArticleLayout
  articleCategory="article 1 category"
  articleTitle="Section and component showcase"
  articleSubtitle="Here's a look at all the components you can use in an article."
  articleTags={["tag1", "tag2", "manufacturing"]}
>
  <SectionWithAside h2="Section with aside">
    <Fragment slot="main-contents">
      <p class="lead">
        Optional subtitle. This section is responsively designed.
      </p>
      <p>
        This is the main part of this section. It also has an aside, or the part
        to the right that contains the image.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can put anything in the main part. You can also put anything in the
        aside. More text, a table, an image of an owl... whatever.
      </p>
      <p>
        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Hic labore sunt
        rerum commodi minus nemo quas libero quam, esse autem.
      </p>
    </Fragment>
    <Fragment slot={"aside-contents"}>
      <ArticleImage
        figSrc={owl}
        figCaption={<span>this is an <strong>owl.</strong></span>}
        figAlt="owl"
      />
      <p>
        This is the aside. On large screens, it's off to the right. On small
        screens, it goes below the main part.
      </p>
    </Fragment>
  </SectionWithAside>
  <SectionBasic h2="Full-width section">
    <p class="lead">Here's the subtitle.</p>
    <p>This section takes up the full width of the screen.</p>
    <p>
      Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Quaerat, fugit
      nulla aperiam itaque exercitationem blanditiis earum perspiciatis
      cupiditate cum laboriosam quibusdam doloribus. Officiis omnis vitae,
      laborum ab cumque quia aperiam.
    </p>
    <ArticleImage
      figSrc={owl}
      figCaption="this caption is a string, unlike the other one."
      figAlt="owl"
    />
    <p>Here's another paragraph.</p>
    <ArticleCallout>
      <div>This is a callout. Put something important here.</div>
    </ArticleCallout>
    <p>
      Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Quisquam nisi
      accusantium magnam libero sapiente quam vero provident vitae saepe
      exercitationem inventore obcaecati commodi laboriosam earum temporibus,
      cum recusandae laudantium itaque architecto, aut quaerat maiores omnis hic
      suscipit? Temporibus illum natus cumque similique deserunt. Nisi nostrum
      nobis officia vero exercitationem quos, nulla, ipsa ad quae neque dolores
      explicabo hic cum illum illo tempore doloribus beatae quisquam laudantium
      reiciendis totam, animi velit. Quasi deserunt suscipit exercitationem
      totam necessitatibus ipsam cumque autem praesentium!
    </p>
    <p>
      Below are cards. You can use these to list things out (such as links),
      compare options, or describe multiple aspects of something.
    </p>
    <ArticleCards>
      <ArticleCard cardTitle="lorem ipsum">
        <p>this is card text</p>
      </ArticleCard>
      <ArticleCard cardTitle="lorem ipsum">
        <p>this is card text</p>
      </ArticleCard>
      <ArticleCard cardTitle="lorem ipsum">
        <p>this is card text</p>
      </ArticleCard>
      <ArticleCard cardTitle="lorem ipsum">
        <p>this is card text</p>
      </ArticleCard>
      <ArticleCard cardTitle="lorem ipsum">
        <p>this is card text</p>
      </ArticleCard>
    </ArticleCards>
  </SectionBasic>
  <SectionBasic h2="Full-width section">
    <p>You can include tables too. For experimental data, perhaps.</p>
    <ArticleFullsizeTable>
      <Fragment slot="thead-contents">
        <tr>
          <th>table head cell 1</th>
          <th>table head cell 2</th>
          <th>table head cell 3</th>
          <th>table head cell 4</th>
          <th>table head cell 5</th>
          <th>table head cell 6</th>
          <th>table head cell 7</th>
        </tr>
      </Fragment>
      <Fragment slot="tbody-contents">
        <tr>
          <td>table body cell 1</td>
          <td>table body cell 2</td>
          <td>table body cell 3</td>
          <td>table body cell 4</td>
          <td>table body cell 5</td>
          <td>table body cell 6</td>
          <td>table body cell 7</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>table body cell 1</td>
          <td>table body cell 2</td>
          <td>table body cell 3</td>
          <td>table body cell 4</td>
          <td>table body cell 5</td>
          <td>table body cell 6</td>
          <td>table body cell 7</td>
        </tr>
      </Fragment>
      <Fragment slot="figcaption-contents"
        ><strong>Table 1.</strong> An example table.</Fragment
      >
    </ArticleFullsizeTable>

    <p>
      Below is a call to action. It prompts the user to take action and acquire our business. Hence, call to action.
    </p>
    <ArticleCta title="Call to action title.">
      <p>This is the first paragraph in the call to action.</p>
      <p>There can also be a second.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a
          class="btn secondary"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          href="https://store.virovek.com/">Browse Premade AAV Products</a
        >
        <a
          class="btn secondary"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          href="https://store.virovek.com/forms/custom"
          >Request a Custom AAV Quote</a
        >
        <a
          class="btn secondary"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          href="mailto:info@virovek.com">Email the team</a
        >
      </div>
    </ArticleCta>
  </SectionBasic>

  <SectionReferences>
    <ol>
      <li id="123">
        Athos E.A., Levinson B., Kistler A., Zemansky J., Bostrom A., Freimer
        N., Gitschier J. (2007). Dichotomy and perceptual distortions in
        absolute pitch ability. Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences
        of the United States of America, 104(37), 14795–14800.
      </li>
      <li>
        Citation name university research institute date et al. names names etc.
        journal conference etc.
      </li>
      <li>
        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Quia quibusdam
        libero molestiae voluptatem consequatur a ipsum hic facere provident
        porro quas alias ullam, id veritatis deleniti obcaecati accusantium!
        Deleniti, libero.
      </li>
    </ol>
  </SectionReferences>
</ArticleLayout>
